# Duskwood (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and manuals whose SOURCE is
# physically in Duskwood for a Horde player, verified against the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Four
# recipes are vendor-sold in-zone by neutral vendors (every buy line
# carries an npc pin to the exact in-zone vendor); five more drop each
# from a named in-zone mob (noted honestly where the same recipe also
# drops in a few other zones). Recipes sold only by Alliance-faction
# vendors are excluded (Alterac rule, flipped — see
# docs/duskwood-horde-companions-inventory.md); every other
# Duskwood-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest
# records carry no reward data, so neither ships (see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Leatherworking, Cooking,
# Fishing, Enchanting, and Tailoring-by-vendor have no Horde Duskwood
# source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/duskwood-horde-recipes
title Duskwood (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns
levels 37-42
zone Duskwood
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords duskwood, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Kzixx's stock — north-east (Alchemy)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Alchemy 1

  vendor 3134 -- Kzixx (81.82, 19.77), neutral vendor
  buy 6053 "Recipe: Holy Protection Potion" npc 3134
  buy 210709 "Recipe: Elixir of Coalesced Regret" npc 3134
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Kzixx's stock — north-east (Engineering)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Engineering 1

  vendor 3134 -- Kzixx (81.82, 19.77), neutral vendor
  buy 7561 "Schematic: Goblin Jumper Cables" npc 3134
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.
  note Also sold by Horde vendors elsewhere; the in-zone source is Kzixx.

step Bliztik's stock — the west (Alchemy)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Alchemy 1

  vendor 2481 -- Bliztik (18.04, 54.36), neutral vendor
  buy 6068 "Recipe: Shadow Oil" npc 2481
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Raven Hill crypt — sterling silver (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 76.88,70.25
  goto 76.91,72.20
  kill 48 optional
  collect 251336 "Plans: Sterling Silver Leggings" optional
  note The Skeletal Warrior (level 21) at Raven Hill is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West coast — clever poultice (First Aid)

  zone map 1431

  when skill First Aid 1

  loop
  goto 21.27,71.96
  goto 21.35,73.36
  kill 910 optional
  collect 255724 "Manual: Clever Poultice" optional
  note The Defias Enchanter (level 26) on the west coast is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West coast — robes of arcana (Tailoring)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 21.27,71.96
  goto 21.35,73.36
  kill 910 optional
  collect 5773 "Pattern: Robes of Arcana" optional
  note The Defias Enchanter (level 26) on the west coast is the named in-zone dropper; the same pattern also drops in Darkshore, the Barrens and Thousand Needles, so this is a genuine Duskwood source, not the only one. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North — invoker's cord (Tailoring)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 15.04,42.00
  goto 15.28,46.38
  kill 531 optional
  collect 215369 "Pattern: Invoker's Cord" optional
  note The Skeletal Fiend (level 24) in the north is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North-east shore — cleric's elixir (Alchemy)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Alchemy 1

  loop
  goto 58.60,9.80
  goto 62.20,11.10
  kill 46 optional
  collect 250366 "Recipe: Minor Cleric's Elixir" optional
  note The Murloc Forager (level 9) on the north-east shore is the named in-zone dropper; the same recipe also drops in Elwynn Forest and Tirisfal Glades, so this is a genuine Duskwood source, not the only one. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step No Horde Duskwood source — other professions

  zone map 1431

  note Leatherworking, Cooking, Fishing and Enchanting have no recipe source physically in Duskwood for a Horde player in the data — no vendor a Horde player can use sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them — and Tailoring has no vendor source here either (Tailoring ships on drops only), so this guide carries nothing for them. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.
